            "text": "<p>We'd love to hear from you. Reach out using the options below.</p><p>Sponsorship</p><p>Interested in partnering with New Jersey MLS NEXT Pro? We're building something new in Middlesex County and looking for partners who want to grow with us.</p><p>Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:partnerships@hometownsoccer.com\" title=\"mailto:partnerships@hometownsoccer.com\">partnerships@hometownsoccer.com</a></p><p>Tickets</p><p>Questions about season ticket deposits, group tickets, or premium seating? Our ticket team is here to help.</p><p>Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:tickets@hometownsoccer.com\" title=\"mailto:tickets@hometownsoccer.com\">tickets@hometownsoccer.com</a></p><p>Press & Media</p><p>For Media inquiries, interview requests, and press credentials, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:press@hometownsoccer.com\" title=\"mailto:press@hometownsoccer.com\">press@hometownsoccer.com</a></p><p>Careers</p><p>Interested in joining our team? We're building a club from the ground up and always looking for talented, passionate people.</p><p>Contact us: <a href=\"mailto:careers@hometownsoccer.com\" title=\"mailto:careers@hometownsoccer.com\">careers@hometownsoccer.com</a></p><p>General Inquiries</p><p>For everything else, use the form below or reach us at <a href=\"mailto:info@hometownsoccer.com\" title=\"mailto:info@hometownsoccer.com\">info@hometownsoccer.com</a></p>",
